  "id": "baked-couscous-with-tomatoes-and-basil",
  "name": "Baked Couscous with Tomatoes and Basil",
  "subtitle": "A warm, savory couscous side with fresh vegetables and Parmesan.",
  "description": "Couscous is combined with sautéed aromatics, tomatoes, basil, balsamic vinegar, and Parmesan, then baked until hot.",
  "meal_type": "side",
